    "detailed_description": "Your animals have all gone missing and it's your job to get them back! Find your animals in adventure mode and collect coins to decorate your farm! Collect them all! <br><br>Farmer Pug Dash is a runner game with a farm that you can decorate with coins earned in Adventure Mode. In Adventure mode you will also find and collect 9 different animals for your farm, including 2 ultra rare unlisted animals that only the most dedicated runners will achieve! Fill your farm with animals and decorations and become the ultimate Farmer Pug!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pugs<br></li><li> Infinite procedurally generated adventure mode<br></li><li> Spend coins found in adventure mode to purchase decorations for your farm<br></li><li> Find 9 different animals for your farm including 2 super secret hidden ones<br></li><li> Pugs<br></li><li> Endless fun<br></li><li> 25 Pugnacious achievements to pad your steam account with pugs and more</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1221830/extras/f07963ba03dcd14a2959dab243ca09b7.avif?t=1685391505\" /></div>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1221830/extras/455d345b35d9c1ef01b1e2fdf2eafba7.avif?t=1685391505\" /></div>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1221830/extras/5f5345b8b9f8d134caf4e8dd9dea58d8.avif?t=1685391505\" /></div>",
